WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:06.297 --> 00:00:10.677
The Dark Army approaches, my lord.
But there is still time for us to escape.

00:00:11.302 --> 00:00:12.971
Why do you think he did it?

00:00:13.471 --> 00:00:16.808
I offered him land
to last his families a lifetime over.

00:00:17.308 --> 00:00:19.686
How could one be so stupid?

00:00:20.395 --> 00:00:22.981
Mitsuhide's prejudice grew beyond repair.

00:00:23.440 --> 00:00:24.983
Hojo Daimyo warped his mind

00:00:25.025 --> 00:00:27.694
and fed his anger
with power and corruption.

00:00:28.194 --> 00:00:30.321
[lord] I was referring to me.

00:00:35.160 --> 00:00:37.871
[grunts] And look at you, Yasuke.

00:00:37.996 --> 00:00:40.415
From servant to samurai.

00:00:40.498 --> 00:00:42.709
The only one who didn't betray me.

00:00:42.834 --> 00:00:45.503
-[metallic clink]
-We should drink to that.

00:00:46.337 --> 00:00:48.048
We do not have time for this.

00:00:48.173 --> 00:00:50.592
The Daimyo is going
to bring hell through those doors.

00:00:50.675 --> 00:00:52.010
Let them come.

00:00:52.594 --> 00:00:55.597
They are the guest of honor
to our little party.

00:00:56.514 --> 00:00:57.348
I--

00:00:58.058 --> 00:01:00.018
[Nobunaga] Yasuke, take it.

00:01:00.060 --> 00:01:02.604
Drink with me. Celebrate this moment.

00:01:02.687 --> 00:01:05.273
[raising voice]
What is there to celebrate, my lord?

00:01:05.356 --> 00:01:09.110
Your forces are scattered.
Your dream of a unified Japan is gone.

00:01:09.194 --> 00:01:12.113
-The temple walls burn as we speak--
-I am still your lord.

00:01:20.580 --> 00:01:24.876
If I die here,
perhaps Mitsuhide will let&nbsp;Ranmaru live.

00:01:25.376 --> 00:01:27.587
Are you sure he made it out in time?

00:01:28.213 --> 00:01:31.382
He was smuggled out
on the last ship, just as you requested.

00:01:32.050 --> 00:01:34.719
-Was he afraid?
-No, he was strong.

00:01:35.220 --> 00:01:36.096
Good.

00:01:36.721 --> 00:01:40.809
Now, all that is left for me
is an honorable death.

00:01:40.892 --> 00:01:43.436
My lord, if we barricade the side entrance

00:01:43.520 --> 00:01:47.148
and force them to enter through the halls,
we can bottleneck their forces

00:01:47.232 --> 00:01:49.317
and then cut them down in waves.

00:01:49.400 --> 00:01:51.152
-[grunts]
-[kettle clatters]

00:01:51.236 --> 00:01:54.405
I appoint you, Yasuke, as kaishakunin.

00:01:55.073 --> 00:01:57.659
This is my final command of you,
my friend.

00:01:57.742 --> 00:02:00.954
What? I don't understand.
We could still fight back.

00:02:01.079 --> 00:02:03.706
[lord] This is the only way
to save Ranmaru.

00:02:03.790 --> 00:02:06.126
No, there is no honor in this.

00:02:06.251 --> 00:02:07.335
-[wood cracks]
-[gasps]

00:02:07.418 --> 00:02:09.087
[flames crackling]

00:02:11.172 --> 00:02:13.341
[battle clamor outside]

00:02:15.969 --> 00:02:18.012
[Nobunaga] Thank you, Yasuke.

00:02:18.096 --> 00:02:19.430
[sword plunges]

00:02:19.472 --> 00:02:21.933
-[gasps]
-[grunting]

00:02:25.103 --> 00:02:27.355
[trembling breaths, grunting]

00:02:33.695 --> 00:02:35.738
[gasping] What are you waiting for?

00:02:46.374 --> 00:02:48.293
[groaning]

00:02:51.546 --> 00:02:55.216
[yells in Japanese] Do it! Do it!

00:02:56.718 --> 00:02:58.303
[yells]

00:02:59.596 --> 00:03:01.139
[gasps, panting]

